# Phoenix Down: the Spirit it targets is no longer there to be exiled if it dies first (CR 608.2b). Bot2 answers the ability by
# bolting its own Bloodghast: the target (now a card in the graveyard) is illegal, the ability does nothing, so the Bloodghast stays
# in Bot2's graveyard rather than being exiled. The Phoenix Down was exiled as a cost, so it is gone all the same.

